// IntroString :
"P2429574797" "Those sonic Freakshow who were playing the Johnny Sonata techno-remix which attracted the Wailers gave me an idea. If we could get hold of some of the sonic tech, we can plant a device on another island and draw the Wailers away from St. Martial! I know the name of a techie who's working for the Freakshow leaders on St. Martial developing their sonic tech. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Get Trey Belcleff from the Freakshow to build you a sonic device.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P1153548930" "Steal sonic device"
// SendOffString :
"P3418005069" "Once we capture Belcleff, we can get him to construct the sonic device to attract the Wailers!"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P746991521" "You kidnap that Freakshow sonic techie yet? Get goin'!"

